WEBVTT

00:01:40.280 --> 00:01:41.130
It's spring!

00:01:43.950 --> 00:01:48.340
It may be a third-rate private school,
but I'm a college student!

00:01:50.630 --> 00:01:54.580
And I should be enjoying
the campus lifestyle.

00:01:54.960 --> 00:01:56.920
I should, but...

00:02:03.290 --> 00:02:04.880
This is how one spells it.

00:02:19.310 --> 00:02:23.100
CUT IT OUT! I have an
entrance exam tomorrow!

00:02:29.330 --> 00:02:30.810
Yo, Godai!

00:02:43.340 --> 00:02:46.490
It's back to cram school
for you!

00:03:11.710 --> 00:03:13.440
You really are worthless!

00:03:13.710 --> 00:03:18.970
You were passed out, then you
scream about an entrance exam!

00:03:20.050 --> 00:03:22.970
Even now, you're still
having ronin flashbacks?

00:03:23.380 --> 00:03:26.440
You must have had
it bad as a ronin.

00:03:27.710 --> 00:03:29.890
Godai!
You awake?

00:03:37.060 --> 00:03:38.660
You okay?

00:03:45.740 --> 00:03:46.750
Thank you, come again.

00:03:47.060 --> 00:03:49.210
- - Pull yourself together!
- - It's spring, but...

00:03:49.410 --> 00:03:51.400
I can't sleep
at night, lately.

00:03:52.080 --> 00:03:54.160
You get that, too?

00:03:55.410 --> 00:03:57.640
My manager
won't let me sleep.

00:04:02.410 --> 00:04:03.880
G-Godai!

00:04:04.090 --> 00:04:06.220
You jerk! You and that gorgeous manager
haven't been...

00:04:06.430 --> 00:04:07.970
Every night!?

00:04:08.430 --> 00:04:09.410
Can't be!

00:04:09.750 --> 00:04:14.330
Idiots! We haven't
even held hands yet!

00:04:15.770 --> 00:04:18.510
Then how does your manager
keep you from sleeping?

00:04:22.770 --> 00:04:27.140
She's in my dreams every night,
but at the best part, I wake up.

00:04:28.450 --> 00:04:31.000
I get so worked up
I can't get back to sleep.

00:04:35.450 --> 00:04:36.950
That's pitiful.

00:04:39.780 --> 00:04:42.710
ls holding hands
too much to ask?

00:04:54.800 --> 00:04:58.090
It's true. Just because
I'm a college student...

00:05:00.150 --> 00:05:02.200
...because it's spring, and
the cherry blossoms bloom...

00:05:03.150 --> 00:05:07.770
...just because the seasons change,
doesn't mean anything ELSE has.

00:05:10.830 --> 00:05:11.550
Godai!

00:05:15.160 --> 00:05:16.110
Manager!

00:05:17.500 --> 00:05:19.840
You're home
pretty early today.

00:05:21.160 --> 00:05:23.770
My afternoon
class was canceled.

00:05:26.160 --> 00:05:27.750
Are you out for a walk?

00:05:28.500 --> 00:05:31.140
Yes, Soichiro needs some exercise.

00:05:41.190 --> 00:05:44.250
I never knew there was such
a quiet spot in this neighborhood.

00:05:54.530 --> 00:05:57.020
I haven't noticed
anyone passing by.

00:05:57.200 --> 00:05:58.210
You're right.

00:06:16.210 --> 00:06:17.060
No!

00:06:17.210 --> 00:06:20.230
Soichiro, quit it!
You can't eat that!

00:06:39.580 --> 00:06:40.210
What's wrong?

00:06:42.580 --> 00:06:44.470
What are you doing, Soichiro?

00:06:57.250 --> 00:06:58.980
Soichiro
come out of there!

00:06:59.920 --> 00:07:01.160
What do you think
you're doing?

00:07:04.600 --> 00:07:05.160
Stop it!

00:07:05.940 --> 00:07:07.900
Soichiro, where are you going?

00:07:13.270 --> 00:07:17.250
Somehow, I get the
feeling I'm being rejected.

00:07:34.640 --> 00:07:35.970
Soichiro!

00:07:40.960 --> 00:07:43.540
That's right. It's
almost that time again.

00:07:46.650 --> 00:07:47.660
Soichiro.

00:08:21.350 --> 00:08:22.800
They're back!

00:08:25.350 --> 00:08:26.420
Soichiro!

00:08:27.690 --> 00:08:29.000
We've been waiting for you!

00:08:29.350 --> 00:08:30.220
Y-You have?

00:08:30.690 --> 00:08:35.250
Your phone's been ringing off the hook.
Must be important.

00:08:36.360 --> 00:08:37.310
Really?

00:08:39.370 --> 00:08:41.830
Kentaro, look after
Soichiro for me.

00:08:43.370 --> 00:08:46.240
S-Sure! Just
leave him to me!

00:08:48.700 --> 00:08:51.170
Ronin, were you
with the manager?

00:08:52.040 --> 00:08:53.480
I'm a college student, now.

00:08:53.700 --> 00:08:55.750
When will you
ever remember!?

00:08:56.040 --> 00:08:58.330
But you haven't changed a bit.

00:08:59.040 --> 00:09:00.980
Did you and the
manager go off together?

00:09:02.720 --> 00:09:04.550
That is a very
good question!

00:09:05.050 --> 00:09:06.250
Where did you go?

00:09:08.400 --> 00:09:11.520
Actually, some quiet,
secluded spot.

00:09:12.060 --> 00:09:13.650
You took the dog
for a walk, right?

00:09:14.400 --> 00:09:15.650
Anything else happen?

00:09:16.060 --> 00:09:18.000
N-Nothing at all!

00:09:18.400 --> 00:09:19.450
Didn't think so.

00:09:21.740 --> 00:09:23.750
Guess maybe I was wrong.

00:09:24.080 --> 00:09:24.930
About what?

00:09:25.750 --> 00:09:30.610
A little while ago I thought
the manager had feelings for you.

00:09:31.420 --> 00:09:32.730
W-What do you mean?

00:09:33.420 --> 00:09:36.230
But since the end of your exams,
she's completely ignored you!

00:09:39.430 --> 00:09:44.500
D-Damn! They're warped,
BOTH of 'em!

00:09:59.450 --> 00:10:00.380
Hello.

00:10:01.450 --> 00:10:04.250
I knew it!
I thought it would be you!

00:10:07.790 --> 00:10:10.560
Next Sunday?
That's fine with me!

00:10:12.790 --> 00:10:13.870
I'll be waiting.

00:10:16.460 --> 00:10:17.600
Soichiro.

00:10:40.490 --> 00:10:44.620
You're the only one who
remains constant, Soichiro.

00:10:47.830 --> 00:10:48.520
Mrs. Ichinose!

00:10:48.830 --> 00:10:50.250
So, what was it?

00:10:51.160 --> 00:10:54.290
The phone!
It was important, right!?

00:10:55.500 --> 00:10:57.080
Then what was it?

00:10:59.500 --> 00:11:00.240
It was my fa...

00:11:04.850 --> 00:11:08.270
Actually, the landlord
is coming next Sunday.

00:11:08.850 --> 00:11:10.250
The landlord?

00:11:10.850 --> 00:11:11.390
Yes.

00:11:11.850 --> 00:11:12.700
But, why?

00:11:13.180 --> 00:11:13.950
I don't know.

00:11:22.200 --> 00:11:23.950
That'll keep
them quiet.

00:11:28.200 --> 00:11:30.770
I've got bad news.

00:11:31.210 --> 00:11:32.200
What is it?

00:11:32.540 --> 00:11:35.640
The landlord is coming
here next Sunday.

00:11:37.540 --> 00:11:40.970
Ain't seen him in years,
now he's coming.

00:11:42.880 --> 00:11:44.870
Something's up.

00:11:45.220 --> 00:11:46.450
The landlord is coming!

00:11:46.890 --> 00:11:48.880
- - Oh, ho.
- -That's the best you can do?

00:11:49.220 --> 00:11:50.080
Ah, ha!

00:11:50.560 --> 00:11:52.490
But for what reason
would he come?

00:11:53.230 --> 00:11:55.370
We've been paying
rent on time.

00:11:55.890 --> 00:11:57.630
Maybe he's just
coming on a whim.

00:11:57.890 --> 00:12:01.210
I see. I must
inform young Godai.

00:12:02.240 --> 00:12:04.430
Therefore, what
do you think, Godai?

00:12:04.900 --> 00:12:08.000
I heard! Why are you all
always in my room!?

00:12:10.240 --> 00:12:11.790
I know why he's coming.

00:12:12.250 --> 00:12:14.410
He's going to
evict bad tenants.

00:12:22.580 --> 00:12:25.430
He wouldn't come
just to raise the rent.

00:12:28.250 --> 00:12:31.410
Demolish this ancient
place and rebuild?

00:12:42.610 --> 00:12:44.720
Next Sunday?

00:13:07.870 --> 00:13:09.390
The dreaded Sunday came.

00:13:13.220 --> 00:13:15.210
And on this perfectly
ordinary spring day...

00:13:15.890 --> 00:13:18.320
...like the sharp
tang of wasabi'...

00:13:19.220 --> 00:13:21.120
...a shocking
incident occurred.

00:13:23.220 --> 00:13:24.120
Hello!

00:13:25.570 --> 00:13:27.490
It is unmistakable.

00:13:27.890 --> 00:13:30.210
It's the geezer I met
when I signed my lease.

00:13:30.570 --> 00:13:31.620
The landlord.

00:13:32.570 --> 00:13:36.410
To me, at least, it
was a shocking incident.

00:13:42.240 --> 00:13:42.800
Hello!

00:13:43.910 --> 00:13:44.760
Father!

00:13:47.240 --> 00:13:49.760
What's going on?
Behave yourselves!

00:13:50.580 --> 00:13:52.330
F-Father?

00:13:52.580 --> 00:13:54.660
So you're the
landlord's daughter?

00:13:58.260 --> 00:14:00.160
I smell a plot.

00:14:00.600 --> 00:14:03.470
You weren't investigating
bad tenants, were you?

00:14:03.940 --> 00:14:05.310
I'm not leaving!

00:14:06.940 --> 00:14:10.970
A guilty conscience
suspects everyone.

00:14:12.280 --> 00:14:13.970
Nice to meet you, Father.

00:14:14.620 --> 00:14:15.960
Father?

00:14:16.620 --> 00:14:18.960
You must be that ronin!

00:14:19.620 --> 00:14:21.700
I'm a college student now, father!

00:14:21.960 --> 00:14:23.260
I see.

00:14:23.620 --> 00:14:26.640
There's that ''father'' again.
What's he doing?

00:14:26.960 --> 00:14:28.730
That's the problem!

00:14:29.300 --> 00:14:31.470
Father, this is
no place to talk.

00:14:32.970 --> 00:14:34.870
Then I'll impose
on your hospitality.

00:14:35.300 --> 00:14:36.160
You too, Ikuko.

00:14:36.300 --> 00:14:37.700
No. I'll wait out here.

00:14:38.640 --> 00:14:40.370
I'll keep you
company for a while.

00:14:41.970 --> 00:14:43.850
Ikoku, don't bother him.

00:14:44.310 --> 00:14:45.230
It's okay.

00:14:45.310 --> 00:14:47.490
Adult conversations
are so boring.

00:14:48.640 --> 00:14:51.160
Then, we won't be long...

00:14:51.640 --> 00:14:52.510
Thank you.

00:14:53.980 --> 00:14:55.220
Shall we go upstairs?

00:14:59.330 --> 00:15:00.410
Brown nose.

00:15:00.660 --> 00:15:01.970
What's with
this ''father'' stuff?

00:15:01.990 --> 00:15:03.160
Traitor!

00:15:10.660 --> 00:15:12.280
Spring is here.

00:15:21.010 --> 00:15:21.620
Here you go.

00:15:23.680 --> 00:15:27.050
I'm relieved to
see you looking so well.

00:15:29.350 --> 00:15:31.820
When I'm here
I don't think about! it.

00:15:32.690 --> 00:15:35.260
You may be right.
There's a lot of weirdos here.

00:15:35.700 --> 00:15:37.510
Maybe that's why.

00:15:42.700 --> 00:15:44.390
Here's a cushion
and some cola!

00:15:44.710 --> 00:15:47.460
Thanks.
You're a nice guy.

00:15:50.710 --> 00:15:52.260
T-Tell your father about it.

00:15:52.710 --> 00:15:53.940
He's my grandpa.

00:15:55.370 --> 00:15:58.190
Grandpa has a bad back,
so I came along.

00:15:59.390 --> 00:16:02.600
So, you're the
manager's niece.

00:16:03.720 --> 00:16:05.120
Wow!
First try!

00:16:06.720 --> 00:16:07.980
How old...?

00:16:08.060 --> 00:16:08.820
Twelve!

00:16:09.390 --> 00:16:10.950
T-That young?

00:16:11.720 --> 00:16:13.910
Do I look that grown up?

00:16:18.410 --> 00:16:20.100
You look pretty
grown up for your age...

00:16:20.410 --> 00:16:22.620
Then how old
is the manager?

00:16:23.080 --> 00:16:24.190
Auntie Kyoko?

00:16:25.740 --> 00:16:26.540
Dunno.

00:16:27.740 --> 00:16:29.040
I-I see.

00:16:37.080 --> 00:16:39.010
Well then, shall we...

00:16:40.080 --> 00:16:40.940
Father!

00:16:43.430 --> 00:16:44.280
ls it your back?

00:16:44.430 --> 00:16:47.390
Yes. It's getting warm, so
I thought I'd be okay.

00:16:51.440 --> 00:16:53.390
You're not up
to the trip?

00:16:53.760 --> 00:16:54.790
But...

00:16:55.780 --> 00:16:57.510
Wouldn't you like
to see Soichiro?

00:17:06.440 --> 00:17:07.460
Grandpa!

00:17:09.450 --> 00:17:11.680
Ikoku, Grandpa's back is hurting.

00:17:12.450 --> 00:17:15.120
What'll we do? We came
all the way out here.

00:17:16.120 --> 00:17:17.140
How awful for you.

00:17:22.140 --> 00:17:24.360
If you'd like,
I can come along.

00:17:24.810 --> 00:17:25.510
Really!?

00:17:25.810 --> 00:17:26.510
Godai...

00:17:26.810 --> 00:17:28.180
We couldn't...

00:17:28.810 --> 00:17:30.740
Let's go, let's go!
C'mon, c'mon!

00:17:31.140 --> 00:17:34.640
If it's some private family thing,
I wouldn't intrude...

00:17:35.470 --> 00:17:36.640
It's not that...

00:17:37.140 --> 00:17:40.340
We can't ask a
complete stranger to...

00:17:40.810 --> 00:17:43.240
''A complete stranger''?
So impersonal!

00:17:44.160 --> 00:17:46.180
Please, let me call you ''father. ''

00:17:47.830 --> 00:17:49.810
Hey-y-y, you and
this guy aren't...

00:17:50.160 --> 00:17:51.680
F-Father, honestly!

00:17:58.840 --> 00:18:01.240
I'm sorry. And Sunday
is your day off, too...

00:18:02.510 --> 00:18:03.560
Don't worry about it.

00:18:04.510 --> 00:18:05.640
Auntie?

00:18:06.850 --> 00:18:09.040
I think he likes me!

00:18:09.850 --> 00:18:11.390
He's so nice to me!

00:18:11.510 --> 00:18:12.810
ls this true?

00:18:13.850 --> 00:18:16.660
You can be a saint, but you
won't marry my granddaughter!

00:18:17.180 --> 00:18:20.030
Start a career, then come
and ask my permission!

00:18:20.860 --> 00:18:22.260
Come on!

00:18:48.560 --> 00:18:52.310
Otonashi family

00:18:56.890 --> 00:18:58.700
So they were coming
to visit a grave site.

00:19:01.560 --> 00:19:03.530
ls this enough water?

00:19:04.240 --> 00:19:05.530
Thank you, that
will be fine!

00:19:26.590 --> 00:19:28.810
Ikoku, pay your respects.

00:19:37.260 --> 00:19:41.210
Godai, if you don't mind, please
say a word for the deceased.

00:19:42.610 --> 00:19:45.620
I will. I think fate
is involved somehow.

00:19:53.610 --> 00:19:54.950
We're honored.

00:20:03.950 --> 00:20:04.880
May I ask whose
grave this is?

00:20:04.960 --> 00:20:05.990
It's my husband's.

00:20:06.620 --> 00:20:09.090
H- - H- - Husband!?

00:20:10.960 --> 00:20:12.010
Y-Your husband!

00:20:42.340 --> 00:20:43.410
Your husband?

00:20:43.990 --> 00:20:45.690
Yes. My husband.

00:20:54.010 --> 00:20:56.790
That is my son, Soichiro.

00:20:57.350 --> 00:20:58.360
Soichiro.

00:20:58.680 --> 00:21:01.410
Kyoko suffered the most.

00:21:02.360 --> 00:21:04.810
Within a half year
of their marriage...

00:21:06.360 --> 00:21:10.450
A mere half year,
Soichiro passed away.

00:21:38.380 --> 00:21:40.530
Are you sure here is fine?

00:21:41.720 --> 00:21:44.440
Any further up the hill, and
a U-turn would be impossible.

00:21:45.060 --> 00:21:46.260
Thanks for
your hospitality.

00:21:46.720 --> 00:21:47.450
Not at all.

00:21:47.720 --> 00:21:48.390
Well then...

00:21:48.390 --> 00:21:49.560
Take care.

00:21:53.410 --> 00:21:55.240
Bye-bye, Big Brother!

00:22:31.780 --> 00:22:35.200
If he had lived, she might
have come to see his flaws.

00:22:38.440 --> 00:22:40.960
But a dead man is
forever perfect.

00:22:43.110 --> 00:22:45.080
They lived together
only half a year.

00:22:46.790 --> 00:22:51.060
Her feelings color her memories.
Memories become idealized...

00:22:55.790 --> 00:22:57.910
Don't do it, Kyoko.

00:22:58.810 --> 00:23:00.540
Don't turn your
back on reality!

00:23:01.470 --> 00:23:03.350
Your Soichiro is dead!

00:23:04.130 --> 00:23:07.610
I- - I'll become a man
worthy of protecting you.

00:23:08.470 --> 00:23:10.460
So... So...

00:23:10.810 --> 00:23:13.860
So look ahead, Kyoko.

00:23:14.810 --> 00:23:15.810
Kyoko...

00:23:16.810 --> 00:23:20.510
Keep looking ahead when
traveling down your road.

00:23:31.510 --> 00:23:34.460
Godai? Look ahead when
walking down the road.

00:23:36.840 --> 00:23:37.910
I-I will.

00:23:50.180 --> 00:23:52.760
Soichiro was the
name of my husband.

00:23:53.530 --> 00:23:57.100
Although he's passed on,
he'll live in my heart forever.

00:23:57.860 --> 00:24:01.190
Next: ''Godai's Agony!
The One Kyoko Loves. ''

00:24:02.190 --> 00:24:06.440
Soichiro... I'll never forget
the happy days we had. Never.
